cff-version: 1.2.0
title: pcsaft-predict
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "ML-Chem Project Team"
    affiliation: "Independent Research"
repository-code: "https://github.com/example/pcsaft-predict"
url: "https://github.com/example/pcsaft-predict"
abstract: >-
  Machine learning pipeline for predicting PC-SAFT equation-of-state parameters
  (m, sigma, epsilon/k) for molecular screening of refrigerant candidates.
  Combines Random Forest baseline with Graph Neural Network (GIN) for improved
  accuracy on halogenated hydrocarbons. Includes thermodynamic validation via
  teqp EOS calculations and applicability domain estimation.
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - pc-saft
  - equation-of-state
  - molecular-property-prediction
  - refrigerants
  - graph-neural-networks
  - random-forest
  - thermodynamics
  - cheminformatics
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-03-15"
